  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project GAIA (&quot;GAIA&quot;)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project GAIA is a blended finance platform that will enable developing countries to access long-term financing from institutional investors for high-impact climate adaptation and mitigation projects in non-objection letter (NOL) countries.



&#x2022; First of its kind blended finance facility combining commercial and concessional&#xa0;capital, including first loss, a TA Facility, to mobilize institutional investors (e.g.&#xa0;pension funds) at scale for adaptation (70%). Investments will align with NDCs and&#xa0;NAPs with quasi-sovereign borrowers, with a target allocation of 25% for LDCs&#xa0;and SIDS.?
&#x2022; The platform will introduce a flexible complement to other sources of climate finance at the country level by providing long-term financing to borrowers in local or hard currency. It will establish a scalable, replicable template that will advance a vital paradigm shift, and unlock private sector financial support.</narrative>
  </description>
